## Uniswap Permit2

`packages/core/src/permit3/` is derived from Uniswap's Permit2. The token
allowance book (`AllowanceTransfer.sol`), the one-shot signature transfers
(`SignatureTransfer.sol`), `SignatureVerification.sol`, the EIP-712 type
strings in `libraries/Permit3Hash.sol`, and the `ISignatureTransfer` /
`IAllowanceTransfer` interfaces are ports or adaptations of the corresponding
Permit2 sources. Each file documents what was kept from Permit2 and what was
changed. `packages/core/src/permit3/README.md` has the same accounting in
prose.

