## Vendored third-party interfaces

`packages/modules/bridge/src/vendor/` contains minimal interface declarations
for Across V3, Circle CCTP, and LayerZero V2 — the handful of function and
event signatures those protocols expose on-chain, transcribed rather than
pulled in as dependencies. Interface declarations of a public on-chain API
carry no implementation from the upstream projects; they are listed here for
completeness.
